###  http://purl.org/PhysicalTherapy#RespiratoryIssue
:RespiratoryIssue rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                           :Contraindication ;
                  rdfs:comment "Caution for advanced respiratory conditions such as COPD or asthma, as extended breath holds or forced breathing patterns may worsen symptoms. Consulting a physician is recommended."@en ,
